      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "The draft already had sang accepted. Its next candidate is softly. The target assigns it probability 0.30, the draft assigns 0.60, and the acceptance draw is 0.80. Predict whether softly is committed, then find the word with positive target-minus-draft mass.",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 19.912,
          "duration": 19.512,
          "until": 21.412
        },
        {
          "say": "The ratio is min of one and 0.30 divided by 0.60, which is 0.50. Since 0.80 is larger, reject softly and discard the dependent proposal today. The positive deficit is 0.00, 0.30, 0.00, so its total is 0.30. Normalizing leaves all correction mass on nearby.",
          "start": 21.412,
          "end": 47.739999999999995,
          "duration": 26.328,
          "until": 48.44
        },
        {
          "say": "The verifier computed state for sang, softly, and today. Keep sang and remove provisional state for the rejected suffix. Then forward the correction nearby on the committed prefix. That forward adds nearby's key and value; the next decode can use them.",
